<section class="page-hero shell"><span class="kicker">CATÁLOGO</span><h1>Las piezas de tu <em>próximo coche.</em></h1><p>Explora todas las opciones disponibles y sus precios orientativos. Cada pieza se puede combinar desde el configurador.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/configurador">Empezar a configurar ↗</a></section><section class="section shell"><div class="catalog-layout"><aside class="catalog-index surface"><h3>Categorías</h3><?php foreach ($labels as $category => $label): ?><a href="#<?= e($category) ?>"><?= e($label) ?> <span><?= count($groups[$category] ?? []) ?></span></a><?php endforeach; ?></aside><div class="catalog-sections"><?php foreach ($labels as $category => $label): ?><section class="catalog-section" id="<?= e($category) ?>"><div class="section-heading"><h2><?= e($label) ?></h2><span><?= count($groups[$category] ?? []) ?> opciones</span></div><div class="part-grid"><?php foreach ($groups[$category] ?? [] as $part): ?><article class="part-card"><div class="part-heading"><h3><?= e($part['name']) ?></h3><strong><?= money($part['price']) ?></strong></div><p><?= e($part['description']) ?></p></article><?php endforeach; ?></div></section><?php endforeach; ?></div></div></section>